



02_regional_methylation.sh

Calculates DNA methylation across user-defined genomic regions using Modkit.
In this study, the regions corresponded to 500-bp windows flanking
RetroInspector-defined TE insertion breakpoints.

The script is run on haplotagged BAM files with Modkit --phased,
producing both haplotype-resolved methylation profiles (HP1/HP2)
and the combined regional methylation profile.
